{
  "title": "The Messaging Inbox: Answer Customers' Texts as a Team | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Customers text the numbers of your business, and someone has to answer. The messaging inbox of CrestApps for Orchard Core is where your team does it together: a shared list of conversations that any agent can claim, answer, close and reopen, with the whole history kept in one place.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why a shared inbox beats one person's phone\n• How the list, the conversation, the composer and the Customer card fit together\n• Searching, filtering and the Available switch\n• Claiming a conversation and replying\n• Closing, marking spam and reopening\n• Favorites and attachments\n• Badges and notices when new work arrives\n• Starting a conversation yourself",
